OL,3,GNEWSAPolice search for owner of teddy
OL,4,Awith human ashes left on train
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are hoping to reunite a teddy
OL,7,Fand an urn containing human remains
OL,8,Fwith its owner after it was left on a
OL,9,Ftrain in Aberdeen.
OL,11,FThe decorative vase, which is cradled
OL,12,Fin the arms of the brown cuddly toy, is
OL,13,Fthought to have been handed in to lost
OL,14,Fproperty at Aberdeen station after
OL,15,Farriving on an LNER service from London
OL,16,FKings Cross.
OL,18,FThe small, red urn is wrapped in
OL,19,Fartificial purple and white flowers and
OL,20,Fhas a golden ribbon tied around its
OL,21,Ftop.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
