OL,3,GNEWSAPolice search for owner of teddy
OL,4,Awith human ashes left on train
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been held in storage by ScotRail
OL,7,Ffor about four months, but officers
OL,8,Ffrom British Transport Police (BTP)
OL,9,Fsaid they had "no further information"
OL,10,Fabout its previous owner.
